# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated. Rebuild, never edit:
#   perl tools/mksingle.pl     -> build/clothes-app.html AND docs/
#   perl tools/mkartifact.pl   -> build/artifact.html
#
# docs/ is ignored. This repository is published from its
# root -- the index.html there forwards into app/, see "Published" in
# CLAUDE.md -- so a committed docs/ would be a second copy of the shop, going
# stale.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
docs/

# Machine-specific: absolute paths, and the Windows account name along with
# them. CLAUDE.md documents the serve commands, so nothing is lost.
.claude/

# The original brief. It stays on this machine: it carries machine paths and
# the Windows account name, and this repository is public.
PROMPT.md

# The owner's photographs as they arrived, on WhatsApp (8 November 2026).
# Copied into app/img/products/ under product names; these originals stay on
# this machine so the repository does not carry every photograph twice.
Catalogue images/

# The notes on what was borrowed from two other projects to get this one
# started. This is a separate shop with its own links, its own storage and,
# later, its own database; the notes are for whoever builds it, here.
FROM-DEVI-AND-MILAN.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. There is none in this project today and there must not be one
# tomorrow.
#
# shop.json holds the UPI id and the gateway KEY ID, and both are public by
# design -- a Razorpay key id is sent to every browser that opens checkout.
# The gateway SECRET is a different thing entirely: it signs the HMAC that
# verifies a payment, it belongs on a server, and it must never reach this
# repository. See the gateway section of CLAUDE.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
